<mjml lang="en">
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Welcome to [Coded Mails]</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>Preview - Welcome to Coded Mails</mj-preview>
    <mj-font name="Muli" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Muli:300,400,700"></mj-font>

    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="Muli, Arial, sans-serif" color="#333333"></mj-all>
      <mj-button
        line-height="30px"
        font-weight="700"
        background-color="#e6b07e"
        color="white"
      ></mj-button>
      <mj-text font-weight="400" font-size="16px" line-height="20px"></mj-text>
      <mj-class name="heading" font-size="20px" line-height="30px" />
      <mj-class name="footer-text" color="#616161" font-size="14px" line-height="20px" />
      <mj-class name="sub-heading" font-weight="400" font-size="20px" line-height="28px" />
      <mj-class name="image-heading" font-weight="400" font-size="14px" line-height="20px" />
    </mj-attributes>

    <mj-style inline="inline">
      h1,
      h2 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 24px;
        line-height: normal;
        font-weight: bold;
      }

      h3 {
        margin: 0;
      }

      p {
        margin: 0;
      }

      .receipt-table td {
        color: #525f7f;
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 24px;
        word-break: normal;
      }

      .receipt-table th {
        padding-bottom: 10px;
        color: #7e7e7e;
        font-size: 12px;
        line-height: 16px;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      a {
        color: #ac7b4c;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .date {
        margin-bottom: 5px;
        font-size: 16px;
      }
    </mj-style>
    <mj-style>
      a,
      span,
      td,
      th {
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased !important;
        -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale !important;
      }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body background-color="#f9f0e6">
    <mj-section>
      <mj-column>
        <mj-spacer></mj-spacer>

        <mj-image align="center" width="75px" src="../../../images/logo-circle-gray.png"></mj-image>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-wrapper background-color="#fff">
      <mj-section padding-bottom="0px">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text mj-class="heading">
            <h1>Hi John,</h1>
          </mj-text>

          <mj-text>
            <p>
              Since the dawn of time, there has been a process to developing web presentations -
              <a href="https://google.com"> you start with a design,</a> get it approved by
              whoever's sitting on the money, then you build from that.
            </p>
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-image
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1550535424-b498819c412f?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&auto=format&fit=crop&w=2102&q=80"
          >
          </mj-image>
          <mj-text mj-class="heading" align="left">
            <p class="date">Janurary 13, 2020</p>
            <h2>God Sea Give Void Wherein Face</h2>
          </mj-text>
          <mj-text>
            <p>
              One morning, when Gregor Samsa woke from troubled dreams, he found himself transformed
              in his bed into a horrible vermin.
            </p>
          </mj-text>

          <mj-button align="left" href="https://google.com">
            <strong>Read more</strong>
          </mj-button>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column width="30%" vertical-align="middle">
          <mj-image
            fluid-on-mobile="true"
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1550535424-b498819c412f?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80"
          >
          </mj-image>
        </mj-column>
        <mj-column width="70%" vertical-align="middle">
          <mj-text mj-class="image-heading" align="left">
            <p class="date">Janurary 13, 2020</p>
            <h3>Targeted progress, innovation entrepreneur catalyze equal opportunity.</h3>
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>
      <mj-section background-color="#f8f8f8">
        <mj-column width="30%" vertical-align="middle">
          <mj-image
            fluid-on-mobile="true"
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1550535424-b498819c412f?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80"
          >
          </mj-image>
        </mj-column>
        <mj-column width="70%" vertical-align="middle">
          <mj-text mj-class="image-heading" align="left">
            <p class="date">Janurary 13, 2020</p>
            <h3>Targeted progress, innovation entrepreneur catalyze equal opportunity.</h3>
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>
      <mj-section>
        <mj-column width="30%" vertical-align="middle">
          <mj-image
            fluid-on-mobile="true"
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1550535424-b498819c412f?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80"
          >
          </mj-image>
        </mj-column>
        <mj-column width="70%" vertical-align="middle">
          <mj-text mj-class="image-heading" align="left">
            <p class="date">Janurary 13, 2020</p>
            <h3>Targeted progress, innovation entrepreneur catalyze equal opportunity.</h3>
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text>
            <p>
              We hope you find these resources helpful, and we’ll be in touch again next week with
              more updates.
            </p>
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>
    </mj-wrapper>

    <mj-section>
  <mj-column>
    <mj-text mj-class="footer-text" align="center">
      © 2020 [Coded Mails], Inc. 123 Louise St. #1234, San Francisco, CA 12221
    </mj-text>
    <mj-text mj-class="footer-text" align="center">
      Update your <a href="https://google.com">email preferences</a> to choose the types of emails
      you receive, or you can <a href="https://google.com"> unsubscribe </a>from all future emails.
    </mj-text>
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>
    <mj-section>
  <mj-column>
    <mj-spacer height="1px"></mj-spacer>
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
